abstract: >-
  Reproducible code for a bilateral fellow-eye reliability analysis in retinal
  artificial intelligence using BRSET v1.0.2. The project evaluates whether
  fellow-eye model output adds information for predicting own-eye model loss.
  Credentialed BRSET data, patient-level partitions, predictions, embeddings,
  and fitted model artifacts are not included.
keywords:
  - retinal artificial intelligence
  - fundus imaging
  - bilateral imaging
  - model reliability
  - loss prediction
  - BRSET
